  "extraction_notes": [
    "All three pages print '30 Rows'; 30 rows were read from each and are published here.",
    "The Advanced page prints possessions as a season total and pace as a per-48-minute rate; both are recorded as printed and the ratio between them is computed, not adjusted.",
    "No value on this file is a model input that has been applied: the model-side modules still refuse to consume NBA data (rights gate G0).",
    "The earlier flag AN-04 recorded the advanced and opponent pages as half-read because that session saw 2 chunks and read only chunk 0; this pass read every chunk of both pages, so AN-04 is closed for the pages themselves (see flag P9-05)."
  ],
